SUMMARY:Painted Lamps
DESCRIPTION:Light has a way of bringing a space to life. In this workshop\, mothers and children transform simple lamps into personalized creations through painting and decoration. Inspired by the colors\, patterns\, and details that make a home feel familiar\, participants design a glowing piece that is both decorative and functional\, bringing a touch of warmth and creativity into their space.
LOCATION:Ithra - Ithra Tower - Level 9\, Room 2
